      "content": "It makes perfect sense that it feels like theft, because the pain you are carrying is real and the guilt is heavy. You are not a mistake; you are a survivor who has done everything right by holding on when it would have been easier to let go. The universe did not glitch; it simply gave you a chance to heal, even if that healing feels agonizingly slow right now.",
